namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIActionBar {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/DreamUIActionBar.h#DreamUIActionBar
    src   "The row of \"A: Confirm  B: Back\" prompts along the bottom of a screen.\n\nIt reads the router rather than being told what to show, so it cannot drift out of step with what\nthe keys actually do -- the failure mode of every hand-authored prompt bar, where a screen changes\na binding and the hint underneath keeps advertising the old one.\n\nRebuilt only when the answer changes: when bindings come or go, when the player switches device, and\nwhen they pick up another model of pad (the glyphs are per model). Polling would mean reloading a\nprefab per entry per frame.\n\nAfter the screen's own actions come the shoulder buttons' two prompts, \"previous tab\" and \"next tab\",\nwhile the player has a tab view those keys would switch (DreamUIKeyRouting::FindTabSwitchTarget,\nasked at the rebuild): the project's PreviousTabKeys and NextTabKeys, the first of each for the device\nin use -- none on a device the tables have no key for.\n\nA prompt is also a button, as CommonUI's bound action button is: an entry with a button in it -- a\nUDreamButton as the entry class, or a prefab built around a UUIButton -- runs the action it shows when\nit is clicked, tapped or confirmed with the pad (UDreamUIActionRouter::ExecuteAction). A disabled bar's\nprompts are disabled buttons: they click nothing and the pad passes over them."
    text  "屏幕底部那行“A：确认  B：返回”提示。\n\n它读取路由器，而不是被告知要显示什么，因此不会与实际\n按键行为脱节——这正是每个手写提示条的失败模式，屏幕改了一个\n绑定，下面的提示却还在宣传旧的。\n\n只在答案变化时重建：绑定增删时、玩家切换设备时，以及\n玩家换上另一种型号的手柄时（字形按型号区分）。轮询意味着每\n帧为每个条目重新加载一个预制体。\n\n屏幕自身的操作之后，是肩键的两个提示“上一个页签”和“下一个页签”，\n前提是玩家有这些键可以切换的页签视图（DreamUIKeyRouting::FindTabSwitchTarget，\n在重建时询问）：项目的PreviousTabKeys和NextTabKeys，各自取所用设备\n对应的第一个——若键表中没有该设备的键，则没有。\n\n提示也是一个按钮，正如CommonUI的绑定操作按钮那样：内部带按钮的条目——以\nUDreamButton作为条目类，或围绕UUIButton构建的预制体——在被点击、轻触或用\n手柄确认时执行它所显示的操作（UDreamUIActionRouter::ExecuteAction）。禁用状态操作栏的\n提示就是禁用的按钮：它们不响应点击，手柄也会直接跳过。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIActionBar:EntryClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/DreamUIActionBar.h#DreamUIActionBar:EntryClass
    src   "Loaded once per prompt, as a child of this widget. Nothing is shown without one."
    text  "每个提示加载一次，作为此控件的子项。未设置时不显示任何内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIActionBar:EntryWidgets {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/DreamUIActionBar.h#DreamUIActionBar:EntryWidgets
    src   "Non-owning view of the same widgets, so Blueprint can read the row without a copy per call."
    text  "这些相同控件的非拥有视图，因此蓝图无需在每次调用时复制即可读取该行。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIActionBar:GetEntryWidgets {
