    state machine
}

DreamUIActionBar:GetPrompts {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/DreamUIActionBar.h#DreamUIActionBar:GetPrompts
    src   "What the last rebuild put on the bar, in order, MaxEntries at most: one prompt per entry -- the same list\nwith no entry prefab to draw it, which is how a test or a bar drawn some other way reads it."
    text  "上次重建按顺序放到栏上的内容，最多 MaxEntries 个：每个条目一个提示——即同一份列表\n但不带用于绘制它的条目预制件，测试或用其他方式绘制的栏正是这样读取它的。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIActionBar:GetUserIndex {
