DreamUIActionBarEntry {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/DreamUIActionBar.h#DreamUIActionBarEntry
    src   "One prompt on the bar: the key glyph or name, and the words beside it.\n\nPut this on the root of the entry prefab and point it at the two or three widgets that draw the\nprompt. Filling those in is all most projects need; anything more elaborate overrides the Blueprint\nevent, which is called after the defaults have been applied and can undo any of them."
    text  "栏上的一个提示：按键图标或名称，以及旁边的文字。\n\n将它放在条目预制件的根上，并指向绘制该\n提示的两三个控件。多数项目只需填好这些内容；更复杂的做法是重写蓝图\n事件，该事件在应用默认值之后调用，可以撤销其中的任何一项。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIActionBarEntry:GetHoldProgress {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/DreamUIActionBar.h#DreamUIActionBarEntry:GetHoldProgress
    src   "0..1 through this entry's hold, kept live by the router. Always 0 for an action that fires on press."
    text  "此条目按住过程的 0..1 进度，由路由器保持实时更新。对于按下即触发的操作始终为 0。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIActionBarEntry:IconImage {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/DreamUIActionBar.h#DreamUIActionBarEntry:IconImage
    src   "The key glyph. Hidden when the action has no icon for the device in use."
    text  "按键图标。当该操作对当前使用的设备没有图标时隐藏。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIActionBarEntry:KeyText {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/DreamUIActionBar.h#DreamUIActionBarEntry:KeyText
    src   "The key's name, for when there is no glyph. Shown exactly when the icon is not, so a prompt is\nnever blank and never says the same thing twice."
    text  "按键名称，用于没有图标的情况。仅在图标不显示时显示，因此提示\n永远不会为空，也不会重复显示相同内容。"
    state machine
}

