DreamUIActionBarEntry:ReceiveOnHoldProgressChanged {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/DreamUIActionBar.h#DreamUIActionBarEntry:ReceiveOnHoldProgressChanged
    src   "Called every time this entry's hold progress moves, and once with 0 when the hold ends.\n\nThis is where a filling ring is drawn. Pushed from the router rather than ticked: an entry for an\naction that fires on press never hears from it at all."
    text  "当此条目的按住进度发生变化时调用，按住结束时再以 0 调用一次。\n\n此处绘制填充圆环。它由路由器推送，而不是逐帧轮询：按下即触发的操作\n所对应的条目完全收不到此调用。"
    state machine
}

